# training/ is scratch space. imitate.js and train.js recreate it on demand and
# fill it with logs, clones and intermediate checkpoints; none of it is worth
# committing. The champion you actually ship is baked into default_brain.js,
# which IS committed, and every Node tool here reads that file by default so a
# fresh clone works with no training directory at all.
training/
# brains exported from the browser land in Downloads, but people move them here
# to compare runs before picking one to bake
tokamak_brain_gen*.json
